{"steam_appid":1331670,"steam_name":"International Space Banana","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1331670/355839/c47e66a1fe005e441b7ba72a70e228080551ebcd/1751222608/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1617192425","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256826957/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1617192425","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/ss_379e3ff40640406b1cabbeff43edf1934fc96943.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741787455","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/ss_7d31b71746e78413dc5accd3c468e56b173f514b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741787455","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/ss_3ef994116030f7e8f26c62a499cd2bc7667aef5a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741787455","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/ss_0480678f2f2b39221c490acaa73f31cd246ccbee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741787455","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/ss_1b1de1d25830fc879a2a3ca563c0bd161e07ef8b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741787455"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/extras/6ea171dfd8971485503cff6a12e145ab.avif?t=1741787455\" width=616 height=205 /></span><br><br>We make one promise, and one promise only. Whether you are a:<br>✅ Bananaphobe <br>✅ Bananaphile <br>✅ Simply a banana yourself<br><br>This game will make you hate <strong><i><u>EVERYTHING</u></i></strong>. <br><br>...but <i><u>especially</u></i> bananas. Especially them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPIN...Desperately</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/extras/f7ce1c4166c51991c31549aa084d098e.poster.avif?t=1741787455\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/extras/f7ce1c4166c51991c31549aa084d098e.webm?t=1741787455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/extras/f7ce1c4166c51991c31549aa084d098e.mp4?t=1741787455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOUNCE...Uncontrollably</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/extras/8fd0e66b1abc6f78824d31c40b67f67a.poster.avif?t=1741787455\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/extras/8fd0e66b1abc6f78824d31c40b67f67a.webm?t=1741787455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/extras/8fd0e66b1abc6f78824d31c40b67f67a.mp4?t=1741787455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRUGGLE...Always</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/extras/5347be8cd52bc2ac7a1e6b595aedfcbb.poster.avif?t=1741787455\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/extras/5347be8cd52bc2ac7a1e6b595aedfcbb.webm?t=1741787455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331670/extras/5347be8cd52bc2ac7a1e6b595aedfcbb.mp4?t=1741787455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience the unique frustrations of controlling a banana in zero-gravity.<br></li><li>Navigate a Spaceship riddled with Space-junk.<br></li><li>Ponder troubling existential questions, as commentary drives you to the brink. <br></li><li>Think about how lucky you are to have ended up as a banana and not some other fruit.<br></li><li>Figure out what you were supposed to be doing before you became a banana in the first place.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Captain's Log - Code B-A-N-A-N-A-N-A</strong></h2><i>&quot;...I don't know what happened, but man, I'm a banana...<br><br>And I can move like a banana. I can rotate through zero gravity like only a banana can. I can latch onto things with my banana body. Thank the lord I am not a kiwi. If I were a kiwi I wouldn't be able to swing my weight around like this and move.<br><br>And I mean to be honest it feels great. This is nice. I'm a nice yellow banana. No bruises. I'm actually a pretty attractive banana. I feel like one of... I feel like the best banana in the bunch. <strong><u>I FEEL LIKE THE BEST BANANA IN THE BUNCH</u></strong>!<br><br>But I'm the only banana in the bunch... Where is everyone?&quot;</i></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 980 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Cool Scooter Software"],"publishers":["PQube"],"release_date":"31 Mar, 2021"}